ow, no longer a takeover, and two tests take the tunnel with lockdown off and on.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"vpnhood/VpnHood","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:59:12Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"97c593d9981a4cebc3e56f3b61147d6ac915151b","github_link":"https://github.com/vpnhood/VpnHood/commit/97c593d9981a4cebc3e56f3b61147d6ac915151b","commit_subject":"Rename only, no behavior change: the tests' BreakableVpnAdapter, AlwaysOnTest's own until now, moves beside the other test devices (VpnHood.Test.Device), for the kill switch tests' error stop.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"microsoft/TypeScript","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:59:08Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"e4b2d9af2fe098367dc2101f420835f8c0d3a048","github_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/commit/e4b2d9af2fe098367dc2101f420835f8c0d3a048","commit_subject":"fix(65076): treat literal U+FFFD as a real rune in regex classes (#65080)","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"dotnet/roslyn","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:59:07Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"cdb2588933f501a57d1546c8486b7fb52d1d3a43","github_link":"https://github.com/dotnet/roslyn/commit/cdb2588933f501a57d1546c8486b7fb52d1d3a43","commit_subject":"Restore non-draft main insertion PRs (#86284)","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"DataBiosphere/consent","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:58:55Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"b03145553e5a38f32994d718f3b0d1ee0bede198","github_link":"https://github.com/DataBiosphere/consent/commit/b03145553e5a38f32994d718f3b0d1ee0bede198","commit_subject":"[DT-4401][risk=no] Skip the OpenAPI validation in Coverage and the image build (#3223)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"TimSoethout/goodwe-sems-home-assistant","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:58:51Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"4052abfb13025cd723b947f6bb8b7d2e40322d2a","github_link":"https://github.com/TimSoethout/goodwe-sems-home-assistant/commit/4052abfb13025cd723b947f6bb8b7d2e40322d2a","commit_subject":"refactor(release): share relea